          "body": "**Changes made:**\n\n| Metadata Name | Metadata Type | Action | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Sign_Up\\__c.Completion_Date_\\_c | Customfield | New Component |\n\n| Sign_Up_Before_Save_Stamp_Completion_Date | Flow | New Component | Entry criteria: If Sign Up Status = Completed and Completed Date is null. |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Sign_Up_Record_Page_v3 | Flexipage | Update Component | Added new section \"System Information\" to temporarily show the read-only field |\n| WT_SignUp_Edit | PermissionSet | Update Component | Added Sign_Up\\__c.Completion_Date_\\_c |\n| WT_SignUp_Read | PermissionSet | Update Component | Added Sign_Up\\__c.Completion_Date_\\_c |\n\n**Testing:** Validated in sandbox.Confirmed working as expected.\n\n**Scenario 1:** Status New>In Progress>Completed (✅ Passed)\n\n**Scenario 2:** Status Completed>In Progress (Manual)>Completed (✅ Passed)",
